---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import QRGeneratorApp from '../react/QRGeneratorApp';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="QR Code Maker — Free Custom QR Code Generator"
  description="Create stunning, fully customizable QR codes with custom colors, logos, frames, and effects. Download in PNG, SVG, or PDF. Free online QR code generator."
  keywords="QR code generator, custom QR code, QR code maker, free QR code, QR code with logo, QR code design"
>
  <!-- Import global styles -->
  <style is:global>
    @import '../styles/global.css';
  </style>

  <!-- 
    The entire QR Generator app loads as a React "client island".
    client:load = hydrates immediately on page load (needed for interactive tool).
    All React logic, state, and API calls remain exactly as before.
  -->
  <QRGeneratorApp client:load />

  <!-- 
    SEO-only content: visible to crawlers in static HTML,
    but positioned below the interactive app.
    This gives search engines rich, crawlable text content.
  -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 text-on-surface" id="about">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-center">Create Custom QR Codes in Seconds</h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-on-surface-variant text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
      QR Code Maker is a free online tool that lets you design and download professional QR codes 
      with full customization — colors, gradients, logos, frames, and effects.
    </p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-16">
      <div class="text-center">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-primary mb-3 block">palette</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">35+ Dot Styles</h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Choose from square, circle, diamond, star, flower, heart, and many more unique dot patterns.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-primary mb-3 block">image</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Logo Embedding</h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Upload your own logo or choose from 18+ preset icons. Automatic background removal included.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-primary mb-3 block">download</span>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">PNG, SVG & PDF</h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Download your QR code in high-resolution PNG, scalable SVG, or print-ready PDF format.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ Section for SEO Rich Snippets -->
    <div class="border-t border-outline-variant pt-12" id="faq">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8 text-center">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <details class="group border border-outline-variant rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center p-4 min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer font-semibold hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors select-none touch-press">
            How do I create a custom QR code?
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 text-primary">expand_more</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="px-4 pb-4 pt-1 text-on-surface-variant text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed border-t border-outline-variant/30">
            Enter your URL, text, or contact information, then customize colors, dot styles, eye patterns, 
            add a logo, choose a frame, and download in PNG, SVG, or PDF format.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="group border border-outline-variant rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center p-4 min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer font-semibold hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors select-none touch-press">
            Is the QR code generator free?
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 text-primary">expand_more</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="px-4 pb-4 pt-1 text-on-surface-variant text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed border-t border-outline-variant/30">
            Yes, our QR code generator is completely free to use with all customization features including 
            colors, logos, frames, and effects.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="group border border-outline-variant rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center p-4 min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer font-semibold hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors select-none touch-press">
            What types of QR codes can I create?
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 text-primary">expand_more</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="px-4 pb-4 pt-1 text-on-surface-variant text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed border-t border-outline-variant/30">
            You can create QR codes for URLs, plain text, vCards (contact information), WiFi credentials, 
            emails, SMS messages, and calendar events.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="group border border-outline-variant rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center p-4 min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer font-semibold hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors select-none touch-press">
            Can I add a logo to my QR code?
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 text-primary">expand_more</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="px-4 pb-4 pt-1 text-on-surface-variant text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed border-t border-outline-variant/30">
            Yes, you can upload your own logo or choose from 18+ preset icons. The QR code automatically 
            adjusts error correction to remain scannable with a logo.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="group border border-outline-variant rounded-2xl bg-surface-container-lowest overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <summary class="flex justify-between items-center p-4 min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer font-semibold hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors select-none touch-press">
            What download formats are available?
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 text-primary">expand_more</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="px-4 pb-4 pt-1 text-on-surface-variant text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed border-t border-outline-variant/30">
            You can download your QR code in PNG (up to 2048×2048 pixels), SVG (infinitely scalable vector), 
            or PDF (print-ready with 300 DPI).
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer with site info & mobile safe area padding -->
  <footer class="border-t border-outline-variant py-8 pb-28 lg:pb-8 text-center text-sm text-on-surface-variant safe-bottom">
    <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} QR Code Maker. Free custom QR code generator.</p>
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>
